Third-party dependencies:
=========================

nuade (downloaded at build time, not vendored)
License: MIT
Source: https://github.com/emoon/nuade
Author: Daniel Collin

nuade's players are translations of Amiga replay routines taken from UADE. Most of those routines carry no stated
license. The players ported from NostalgicPlayer (https://github.com/neumatho/NostalgicPlayer, Thomas Neumann) keep its
MIT license, and some players include data copied from an eagleplayer. nuade's THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists which
players fall under which, and is the authority for redistributing a build of this plugin:
https://github.com/emoon/nuade/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
